  1: # AIROBOT 运维手册
  2: 
  3: **目标**：开发/部署/故障排查一体化参考
  4: 
  5: ---
  6: 
  7: ## 1. 启动 / 停止
  8: 
  9: ### 1.1 后端
 10: 
 11: **方式 A：LaunchAgent（推荐，AGENTS.md 强制）**
 12: 
 13: ```bash
 14: # 查看状态
 15: launchctl list | grep airobot
 16: 
 17: # 启动
 18: launchctl start com.airobot.autostart
 19: 
 20: # 停止
 21: launchctl stop com.airobot.autostart
 22: 
 23: # 重新加载配置（修改 plist 后）
 24: launchctl unload ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.airobot.autostart.plist
 25: launchctl load ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.airobot.autostart.plist
 26: ```
 27: 
 28: **方式 B：手动（开发用）**
 29: 
